    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Taylor Smith",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109086678715239150691/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJPYw-st9CVN8XGfz4EmC2kCFDZ60XZQXClIK8Y8B5bl6gfSQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Have brought my puppy before, but this time I picked her up and she had a cut on her nose! The groomer said she didn’t know how it happened… I would hope that the workers would keep better eye on the dogs there, seeing as it’s literally their job lol. I hate writing bad reviews, sorry, but I was really upset with the gash on my pup’s nose. I had to get her cream from a vet for it and she now has a white scar. Also don’t expect a clear and professional phone conversation when making a reservation, it’s extremely loud in the background and there’s no receptionist so you gotta chance it that the groomer isn’t with a dog.\n\nThat’s all, workers were always nice though! Just had to vent my emotions🧘‍♀️.",
        "time": 1722724943,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Larry white",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114652938446315551457/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKJvWZ32crGaZKguL04CG6ggM4BwFbkdjOPOtYiVMPWfAyEmA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 years ago",
        "text": "Chico has been groomed here for 7 years and we are always very satisfied with the services provided.",
        "time": 1658840846,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Christina Murphy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111551128713606927032/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI5P5KU9LSDpEqrN64jLRzI-Dha2VPFaFfIYLQC825bu5KzUA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Terrible, first time. I have a 1 year old  goldendoodle. They cut the bottom of his ear off..not one ear but BOTH!\nIf you must go, stay with your beloved pet and protect them. I regret leaving him alone, my poor baby.",
        "time": 1705768607,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mindy Jerebic",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116419631768307441772/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0OtdMRsvDZaBqK5pj_PGAtRCNsNl3R5GW4iSrdQTMow1xJvzPlw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Quick service, was able to get an appointment fast. My cat was very difficult for them, cut is a little uneven but under the circumstances of how difficult the job was i'm quite pleased. They seem to love animals & complimented my girl despite how aggresive she was with them during her grooming.",
        "time": 1531603342,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jenel Brule",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114376416904090580235/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKD9Mi-XehFMgEnRiLY1YodoSlWJamC-sx9_X7otKBMSan45g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "This place is amazing! They are so nice and they are amazing at handling my admittedly rambunctious cat. He looks so great!",
